  "content": "<section>\n<div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>整合材質包相容性 <em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/immersive-interfaces-mod-support-unofficial\" rel=\"nofollow\">沉浸式介面 - 模組支援非官方版</a></em></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/immersive-interfaces-mod-support-unofficial\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/zW0OkthM/e9f003365e0bd2251993b6ae30bfca6ae2d6c56a.png\" alt=\"沉浸式介面 - 模組支援非官方版\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a></strong></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong>其他部分相容性：</strong></em></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/immersive-interfaces-curios-api-mod-support\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1292547/description_abbc37df-dab3-456d-8af4-12acb6e98bea.png\" alt=\"沉浸式介面 - Curios API 模組支援\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/immersive-interfaces-trinkets-mod-support\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1292547/description_725e17b5-3d84-444c-b3f7-7fdf64f8b436.png\" alt=\"沉浸式介面 - Trinkets 模組支援\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/immersive-interfaces-cosmetic-armor-reworked-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1292547/description_35671bdb-dd62-4da0-a6a6-d4433b1e3f6d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/immersive-interfaces-farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1292547/description_29d985aa-9597-47ad-b9dd-34328e684b54.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/immersive-interfaces-easy-magic\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1292547/description_7ce1a2e6-a04a-4531-b400-6cb5211ab87e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/immersive-interfaces-just-enough-items-jei\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1292547/description_614f15c2-433a-497c-a85d-7497ded65b08.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/immersive-interfaces-accesories-curios-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1292547/description_3bb78bab-4957-43ff-a994-af576e65339f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/immersive-interfaces-sophisticated-backpacks\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1292547/description_7c5c0c44-933c-47df-97b7-0e734d41b1ed.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/immersive-interfaces-spell-engine-rpg-series\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1292547/description_b862eba6-89be-4a71-965b-f40a34e8c46c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/immersive-interfaces-quark\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1292547/description_f7df0cf5-a4c7-43da-834c-bbf3d7cee1bd.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/immersive-interfaces-travelers-backpack\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1292547/description_33e72ccd-8ca5-4657-92d9-66d6d1f3c263.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/immersive-interfaces-roughly-enough-items-rei\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1292547/description_b7eca5eb-ada1-430e-8145-d1119a92314d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/immersive-interfaces-roughly-enough-items-rei\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1444975/description_f739db58-1fdc-4ace-892f-a9d1dd942848.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>此材質包專為與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/emi\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMI</a> 相容而設計，將其設計元素整合至沉浸式介面的視覺風格中。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>之前：</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1292547/description_c0277ef6-ff34-4ba9-9bd8-5c8a0b92c862.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>之後：</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1292547/description_0f0b197e-4476-4ed5-863d-941ccc67af0d.png\"></strong></p>\n</div>\n</section><div>\n<div>\n<div style=\"width:22px\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"width:300px;font-size:13px\">\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
